    "title": "<p>Grading systems for immature teratoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Peter Karl Bode",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Grade</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 346.4pt; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: none; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"462\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Amount of incompletely differentiated (embryonal) tissues</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.2pt; border: none; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"226\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Gonzalez-Crussi</span></strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\"><span style=\"\">{580884}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Norris<sup>a</sup></span></strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\"><span style=\"\">{1260722}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"226\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&lt;&nbsp;10%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&lt;&nbsp;1&nbsp;low-power field in any slide</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">2</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"226\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; \">10&ndash;50%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; \">1&ndash;3&nbsp;low-power fields in any slide</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>3</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 169.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"226\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;50%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&gt;&nbsp;3&nbsp;low-power fields in any slide</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"\">a</span></sup><span style=\"\">The</span> grading of immature teratoma according to Norris <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{1260722}</span> is based on the number of low-power microscopic fields (4.5&nbsp;mm in diameter and 15.9&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup> in area, 40&times; total magnification) containing aggregated amounts of immature neuroepithelium in any one slide.</p>",
